      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When encountering unusual symbols or figures, document them objectively in the 'description' or 'coverage' field with precise terminology. Use phrases such as \"contains symbols of unidentified origin,\" \"features non-standard cartographic notation,\" or \"includes marginal notations with unknown meaning.\" Emphasize that the identification of these entities is speculative, but also note any understood patterns or contexts that have been established. This approach allows you to provide an informative record without making unfounded assertions.",
